{% extends "base.html" %}
{% load static %}
{% load blog_tags %}

{% block title %}Privacy Policy{% endblock %}
{% block extra_css %}
<style>
    .privacy-policy {
        padding: 2rem;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        margin-top: 130px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        width: 90%;
    }

    .privacy-title {
        color: #007bff;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .privacy-text {
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: #232323;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .privacy-policy {
            padding: 1rem;
        }
    }
</style>
{% endblock %}


{% block content %}

<div class="privacy-policy container">
    <h1 class="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        Thank you for visiting Auto Haul Express LLC. Your privacy is our priority, and we are fully committed to
        safeguarding your personal information. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect the
        information you share when visiting our website.
    </p>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        By using our site autohaulex.com, you agree to the terms detailed in this Privacy Policy:
    </p>

    <h2 class="privacy-title">1. Introduction</h2>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        Welcome to Auto Haul Express. By accessing or using our services, including receiving SMS communications, you
        agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with these terms, please do
        not engage with our services.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="privacy-title">2. Consent for SMS Communication</h2>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        By providing your consent to receive SMS communications, you acknowledge and agree to receive text messages from
        Auto Haul Express at the phone number you provide. Information obtained as part of the SMS consent process will
        not be shared with third parties.
    </p>
        

    <h2 class="privacy-title">3. Types of SMS Communications</h2>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        If you have consented to receive text messages, you may receive SMS communications related to the following:
    </p>
    <p>Customers and Guests: Updates regarding your orders, deliveries, or other relevant information.
        Job Applicants: Information about your application status, onboarding materials, or other employment-related
        updates.</p>
    <h2 class="privacy-title">4. Standard Messaging Disclosures</h2>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        Message Frequency: Frequency of messages may vary depending on your interactions with us.
        Standard messaging rates will be charged by your mobile service provider.
        You can opt-out of receiving SMS messages at any time by texting "STOP" to the number from which you received
        the message.
        For assistance, text "HELP" " to any text message or contact us directly at (281) 975-6026, you can email us at
        support@autohaulex.com or visit our https://autohaulex.com/privecy-policy
    </p>

    <h2 class="privacy-title">5. Security:</h2>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        We take your security seriously and have implemented physical, electronic, and managerial safeguards to protect
        the information you provide.
    </p>

    <h2 class="privacy-title">6. Changes to this Privacy Policy:</h2>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        Auto Haul Express LLC may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time. All changes will be posted on this page,
        with the date of the last update clearly indicated.
    </p>

    <h2 class="privacy-title">7. Contact Us:</h2>
    <p class="privacy-text">
        For any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us at <a
            href="mailto:support@autohaulex.com">support@autohaulex.com</a>.
    </p>

    <br><br>
    <p>•SMS consent and phone numbers provided for SMS purposes will not be shared with any third parties or affiliates
        for marketing purposes.</p>
</div>
{% endblock %}

